OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Flargely dry and fine this evening with
OL,7,Fclear spells. Mist and fog patches
OL,8,Fdeveloping under light winds. Low
OL,9,Fcloud and patchy rain arrive in the
OL,10,Fnorth and west later on. A chillier
OL,11,Fnight than last night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FMist and fog gradually lift
OL,14,Finto brief sunshine in the south
OL,15,Fwhilst cloud and patchy rain further
OL,16,Fnorth gradually moves southeastwards
OL,17,Fthrough the day, clearing overnight.
OL,18,FTemperatures near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
